          "extracted_at": "2026-01-25T17:15:21.429920",
          "full_text": "The denizens of the Dark City are well versed in deceit and betrayal. In battle, they put these talents to good use, hitting their foes hard before melting away into the shadows. Use this firefight ploy during a friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON  operative’s activation, before or after it performs an action. During that activation, that operative can perform the Fall Back action for 1 less AP.",
