          "extracted_at": "2026-01-25T17:15:21.430095",
          "full_text": "To the conceited Drukhari, all opponents are little more than vermin – to be ignored or exterminated. Use this firefight ploy when it’s your turn to activate a friendly operative. You can skip that activation.",
